{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14248","headline":"酬舍弟牟秋日洛阳官舍寄怀十韵 · 窦常","name":"酬舍弟牟秋日洛阳官舍寄怀十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幼爲逃难者，才省用兵初。\n去国三苗外，全生四纪余。\n老头亲帝里，归处失吾庐。\n逝水犹呜咽，祥云自卷舒。\n正郎曾首拜，亚尹未平除。\n几变陶家柳，空传魏阙书。\n思凌天际鹤，言甚辙中鱼。\n玉立知求己，金声乍起予。\n在朝鱼水分，多病雪霜居。\n忽报阳春曲，纵横恨不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}